# Contacts — {{PROJECT}}

> This file is yours (project-owned). It is the **people ledger** — one entry
> per contact, a person at an account. `/contact` creates and updates entries
> and attaches a person to an account. Read `.claude/crm-rules.md` for the
> record; `.claude/crm-gate.md` for this business's contact-roles taxonomy.

**Ids** are `CON-NNN`, monotonic, never reused. Every contact carries an
`account: @acct-<slug>` (the join to `crm/ACCOUNTS.md`) — a contact with no
account is an orphan. At most one `primary: yes` per account.

**Legend** — `CON-NNN` (contact id) · `account: @acct-<slug>` (join to the
account hub) · `role` from the gate's contact-roles taxonomy ·
`primary: yes|no`. Grouped by account.

